<title>USA: McGraw-Hill hires Dow Jones executive.</title>
<headline>McGraw-Hill hires Dow Jones executive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>McGraw-Hill Cos Inc said Wednesday Jim Davies has been appointed president of Standard &amp; Poor's J J Kenny Co, part of the corporation's S&amp;P Financial Information Services unit.</p>
<p>Before joining McGraw-Hill, Davies was vice president of sales, marketing and client services at Dow Jones &amp; Co Inc's Dow Jones Telerate, the company said.</p>
<p>McGraw-Hill said Davies will oversee the management of Standard &amp; Poor's municipal securities division in his new job.</p>
</text>
